<div class="container section">
  <h1>About FBISE Study Hub</h1>
  <p class="lead">FBISE Study Hub is a free study platform built for students of the Federal Board of Intermediate and Secondary Education (FBISE), Pakistan — covering Class 9 (SSC Part I), Class 10 (SSC Part II), Class 11 (HSSC Part I) and Class 12 (HSSC Part II).</p>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>What we offer</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Past papers</strong> — organised by class, subject, year and examination session.</li>
      <li><strong>Model papers</strong> — official FBISE model papers clearly marked, plus labelled practice papers.</li>
      <li><strong>Online quizzes</strong> — chapter-wise multiple-choice practice with instant scoring and answer review.</li>
      <li><strong>Personal dashboard</strong> — save papers, revisit quiz attempts and track your progress.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Our approach to accuracy</h2>
    <p>We only label a document as an official FBISE past or model paper when its authenticity has been verified. Practice questions and extra study material are always clearly labelled as practice — never presented as official board documents. If a paper is not yet available, we say so instead of showing a broken link.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>FBISE Study Hub is an <strong>independent educational resource</strong>. It is <strong>not officially affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Federal Board of Intermediate and Secondary Education (FBISE)</strong>. Board names and related terms are used only to describe the syllabus the resources follow.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band card">
    <h2>Have feedback or found a mistake?</h2>
    <p>We improve the library with help from students and teachers. Use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> to report errors or request resources.</p>
  </section>
</div>

